      "message": "Interesting. It kind of looks like an off-by-one error.\n\nFor example, when specifying `1` second, the delay is ~0, `2` seconds, is ~1, 3 seconds is ~2, etc.\n\n(The `1` case is a bit of an outlier since it\u0027s really around 600ms, but the other numbers look like they\u0027re pretty close to exactly off by one).\n\nI would look at the documentation for the NPCX RTC registers used [in this code](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/chip/npcx/system.c;l\u003d690-732;drc\u003d0bcf0fbafc375d4d44c2b7991d998241674936e4) to see if we\u0027re setting the right values. You could also file a bug against Nuvoton to see if they can review this.",
